# Alchemy recipe cost

When creating or editing recipes in `src/ingredients.json`, follow the project skill `alchemy-recipe-cost`:

ingredients cost can't exceed elixir cost price and be lower than 75% of target elixir price

Recompute `ingredients_cost`, `recipe_cost`, and `elixir_cost`, then run:

```bash
python3 .cursor/skills/alchemy-recipe-cost/scripts/validate_recipe_costs.py
```
